On Powered Melee Kills:
Grants <void/>Void Invisibility and restores Health.

{Finishers} increase the duration of <void/>Void Invisibility and restore additional health.

Invisibility Duration | Health based on <link enemy rank [https://d2clarity.page.link/combatant] />:
• Minors: 6.8 seconds [9.8s} | 100 HP {?)
• Elites, Enemy Players: 9.8s {12.7s} | ? HP {200 HP}
• Minibosses = 12.8s {15.8s} | ? HP {200 HP}
• Bosses = 13.3s | 200 HP {Not Finishable}

Echo of Persistence increases the <void/>Void Invisibility duration by 41.5%.

